WEBVTT

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:01.327
so we did just that.

00:05:01.351 --> 00:05:02.888
The company went to Mexico,

00:05:02.912 --> 00:05:04.217
they flew the LiDAR

00:05:04.241 --> 00:05:05.886
and they sent back the data.

00:05:06.554 --> 00:05:10.733
Over the next several months, I learned
to practice digital deforestation,

00:05:10.757 --> 00:05:14.426
filtering away trees, brush
and other vegetation

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.557
to reveal the ancient
cultural landscape below.

00:05:18.338 --> 00:05:20.787
When I looked at my first visualization,

00:05:20.811 --> 00:05:22.087
I began to cry,

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.175
which I know comes
as quite a shock to you,

00:05:25.199 --> 00:05:27.131
given how manly I must seem.

00:05:27.155 --> 00:05:28.993
(Laughter)